WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.690
Now, we're going to raise
Kaleido Star's curtain.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:05.350
When you watch Kaleido Star,

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.690
you should keep your room brightly lit

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.250
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:11.990
Well, well, well.

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:14.450
Everyone, have you ever thought
"l can't do this anymore"?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.530
Even though you work to your limit,

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.860
there is nothing you can do about it.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.730
But there is somebody waiting for you.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.800
Someone who encourages you
and is tough on you.

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:23.570
Friends should be able to trust each other.

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.540
Because I'm not the only one
having a hard time.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:26.970
I'm not! I'm not!

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:35.250
<i>Dare mo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:35.250
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be someplace</i>

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.750
<i>Dokoka ni aru</i>

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.750
<i>It has to be somewhere</i>

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:45.460
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja nai</i>

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:45.460
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:59.810
<i>Saigo made yareru to ittetane</i>

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:59.810
<i>Remember how I used to say
I could make it to the end?</i>

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:06.180
<i>Kitto tsuyogatte itanda</i>

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:06.180
<i>I must have been pretending to be tough</i>

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:14.890
<i>Itsudatte muchabakka de
zutto karamawari de</i>

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:14.890
<i>Everything I did was reckless
and it never got me anywhere</i>

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:21.450
<i>Dakedo anata dake ga soba ni ita</i>

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:21.450
<i>But you alone were always beside me</i>

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:28.140
<i>Daremo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:28.140
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be somewhere</i>

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.740
<i>Aruki daseru</i>

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.740
<i>You can start going forward</i>

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:36.280
<i>Koko kara nani kaga hajimaru</i>

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:36.280
<i>From this moment, something will start</i>

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:38.310
<i>Shinjite itai</i>

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:38.310
<i>I want to believe that</i>

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:45.820
<i>Mada minu hikari yakusoku no
basho e to tsuzuite yuku</i>

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:45.820
<i>The light I haven't seen yet
is beaming toward the promised place</i>

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:56.290
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja naisa</i>

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:56.290
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:16.990
Then I'll go to the river and do the laundry.

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:18.010
Okay.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.660
Charlotte, Julie.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:24.460
So, you were here.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:25.620
Oh...

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:27.060
It's like, been awhile.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.030
What happened to Kaleido Stage?

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:30.200
Did you quit?

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.430
Well, you know...

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:33.700
We couldn't agree with that Yuri guy.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.840
Well, it's more like we were fired.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:36.670
Shush!

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:37.610
How is Sora?

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:38.910
Is she working hard?

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:40.970
She's way past "working hard."

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.410
It looks super miserable.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:45.850
If you ask me, it's pretty extreme.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:47.540
If it were me, I'd like, die.

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:50.250
I don't know how she can endure that.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.780
I've got a bit of renewed respect for her.

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.420
That's right. That's right.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.290
What kind of training is she doing?

00:02:57.990 --> 00:02:58.360
"The Amazing Intensive Training Continues"

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:01.400
The Amazing Intensive Training Continues

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:01.400
"The Amazing Intensive Training Continues"

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:04.300
The Amazing Intensive Training Continues

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:07.500
Until the day they perform
the legendary great maneuver,

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.800
we're holding special events everyday.

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:12.800
I really want everyone to come.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.140
The atmosphere at Kaleido Stage
is really heating up.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:19.480
By the way, what's all this
about making the tickets non-refundable

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.180
even if they can't perfect
the legendary maneuver?

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:27.320
I personally feel pain when I think of
how they suddenly canceled "Freedom"

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:29.190
even though it was
the previous owner's fault.

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:34.260
Refunding the money at that time
was very tough financially.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:37.170
So we made everything clear this time,

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:41.370
and sold the tickets only to those
who understood the situation.

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:43.210
Then, have you gotten any complains?

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:44.700
None.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.410
According to rumor,

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.640
the last person to challenge this great maneuver

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.580
was your father.

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:52.350
Yes.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:55.720
But he died in an accident
during practice.

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:56.510
Oh my...

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.960
So the maneuver is that hard.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:04.390
That's why I definitely want
the performance to succeed this time.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:09.900
This channel will be broadcasting
live on the day of the event.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.900
So, how is the progress of
the legendary great maneuver?

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:16.270
Well, I doubt they will perfect it.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.730
I'm 99% certain that the
performance will be canceled.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.410
Thanks to the publicity
about the legendary great maneuver,

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.610
the attendance is picking up again.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:27.250
Also, sales of related merchandise
are going well.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:29.770
All thanks to this legendary great maneuver.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:31.350
After the cancellation,

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:34.790
I'll announce that Layla and l
will attempt the maneuver again.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.290
By doing so, we can generate
even more publicity and...

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:36.690
That's enough, thank you.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:36.690
By doing so, we can generate
even more publicity and...

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:37.280
That's enough, thank you.

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:40.560
When we cancel the performance,
we can end Kaleido Stage too.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:43.720
We're going to sell Kaleido Stage.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:45.700
But...

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:49.040
If we keep letting you manage it,
I'm afraid that we'll lose a lot of money.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:52.040
I bet old man Kenneth knew this was coming.

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:54.440
That's why he backed out of the
investment so quickly.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:04:59.280
Next!

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.150
Okay.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.020
Sora!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.670
Oh... Mia, Anna...

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:21.730
You're here.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.770
Are Jonathan and everyone doing all right?

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:26.810
You don't need to chitchat.

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.080
What is this?

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.750
This? Special training.

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.850
Special training?

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:33.470
You're terrible, doing
something like this to Sora.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:35.280
Stand up, Sora.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:37.770
Unless you work hard,
you can't catch up with Miss Layla.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:39.690
I know.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:40.520
Sora...

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:41.620
This is reckless!

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:45.650
Being reckless is my specialty. So...

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:47.360
Sora!

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:48.290
Sora!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.570
Ken, please let Sora rest!

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:51.630
Let's take her to the lodge!

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:53.030
Okay.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.410
Even though it's training,

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:59.570
I can't believe she did that
until she became so bruised and tired.

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:01.080
I can't believe Ken, either.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.980
I thought he would protect her.

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:09.180
Oh, shoot!

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:10.650
Why am I sleeping?

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:11.450
I have to practice! Otherwise...

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:12.020
Sora!

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:12.020
I have to practice! Otherwise...

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:12.290
Sora!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:12.290
I can't catch up with Miss Layla!

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:13.120
Where are you going?

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:13.120
I can't catch up with Miss Layla!

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:13.460
I can't catch up with Miss Layla!

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:13.820
Wait!

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:13.820
I can't catch up with Miss Layla!

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:14.290
Wait!

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.520
No! You have to get more rest!

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.520
I have to catch up with Miss Layla...

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.090
No! You have to get more rest!

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:17.180
Calm down, Sora!

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:19.900
If you don't rest, you'll break down, Sora.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.300
You're doing too much.

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:25.800
Thank you, but I'll be okay.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:29.870
'Cause Miss Layla has already
advanced to more difficult training.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:30.670
Sora!

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:50.930
Even Miss Layla is practicing,
bruising herself all over.

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.030
That legendary great maneuver...

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:57.400
It must be a much harder maneuver
than we ever imagined.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:58.770
Yes...

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:01.100
What should we do about that story?

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.540
I know...

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:04.810
I think it's better that we don't tell her.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:06.030
You're probably right...

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:08.810
Good!

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:13.010
I did it.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:15.920
It means nothing if you did it by accident.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.620
So I want you to try hard
until you can do it ten times consecutively.

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:20.860
Yes!

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:21.920
I'm starting.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.360
Yes!

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:35.570
I'm beginning to understand
what the legendary great maneuver is.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:40.770
If I can do that kind of maneuver,
it would be truly wonderful, but...

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:47.340
I can't do that with my partner
in her current state.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:52.890
Miss Layla,

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:54.860
aren't you going to eat any more?

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:56.350
No...

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:59.290
It seems I have lost my appetite today.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:00.900
Starting tomorrow,

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:02.500
I'll take my meals in my room.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:03.330
Oh... Yes.

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:05.460
Miss Layla...

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:16.780
You did it!

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.280
You did it ten times consecutively.

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:19.610
We will advance to the next level.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.220
Hurry!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:31.320
I want to receive the applause that makes my
whole body tremble.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:34.700
Sora, no matter what happens,

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:38.330
I'm going to perfect the
legendary great maneuver with you.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.300
Yes!

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:48.410
Just keeping the posture itself is hard enough.

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:52.010
But to swing that high on top of it...

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.100
Just how long are you going to rest?

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:55.740
Yes!

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.860
Don't you think Miss Layla seems
irritated somehow?

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.460
She even said she wanted to
have meals all by herself.

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:12.260
Charlotte's cooking is kinda bad, you know?

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:13.930
You're lying! You serious?

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.700
I don't think it is.

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.340
She's right. Your cooking is pretty good.

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:18.540
That's what I thought.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:20.130
Now I feel better.

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:26.380
Miss Layla is irritated
because I'm not good enough.

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:31.210
I wonder if I'm really able to be
Miss Layla's partner like this.

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:53.740
After a week, she finally started
showing stability,

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:57.080
but it looks like she's lost her motivation.

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:58.980
I can't watch!

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:01.050
Let's go help Charlotte and Julie.

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:02.680
Okay...

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:19.870
Miss Layla,

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.860
why won't you say anything?

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.210
Something like, "Try harder,"

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:29.110
"be strong,"

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:31.440
or "you can never be my partner
if you're like that."

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:34.880
Please say something.

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:36.950
Say anything!

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:38.440
Please, Miss Layla!

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:41.150
Sora...

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:43.950
I have nothing to say.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:23.950
Mr. Kenneth...

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:26.360
What business brought him?

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:29.770
Is something wrong, coming all the way here?

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:33.200
What's with that woeful face, Sora?

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:34.140
What?

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.340
You look like you have no fighting spirit at all.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.140
Your eyes are empty.

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:43.850
You hardly look capable of
doing that legendary big maneuver.

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:45.880
She's tired now because
she just finished training.

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:50.690
I guess everything is just
the way those guys wish.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:51.820
Those guys?

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:56.230
Those squirts who are
investing in Kaleido Stage.

00:11:56.930 --> 00:12:01.830
None of them think you will
perfect the legendary great maneuver.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:02.700
What?

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:06.540
Even if the maneuver is not perfected,

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:08.040
they think it will be all right
as long as they can make a profit

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.640
through the events leading up
to the day of the actual event.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:12.550
That's horrible...

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:15.520
Rather, they're thinking it would
be better if the performance is canceled.

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:18.820
That way, they can save on the expenses.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.760
But what about the audience?

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:27.020
Can you say with confidence that
you will never disappoint the audience?

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:34.160
Can you say with confidence that
you will perfect that maneuver with Layla?

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:36.660
Well...

00:12:36.970 --> 00:12:41.430
Can you say with confidence that
you're Layla's partner?

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:45.880
Something like, "Try harder,"

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:48.780
"be strong,"

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:51.340
or "you can never be my partner
if you're like that."

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:53.920
Please say something.

00:12:53.920 --> 00:12:55.950
Say anything!

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.610
Please, Miss Layla!

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:01.690
I have nothing to say.

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:03.890
I...

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.590
Sora!

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.240
How could you ask her something like that?

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:17.740
She's desperately trying to rouse herself
even though she's discouraged!

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:21.670
Well, I think I'll go inside and get some rest.

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:24.250
What? Wait!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.450
Bring me some coffee, boy.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.650
My name is Ken Robbins.

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.340
Sora...

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.930
I couldn't answer.

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:55.950
I couldn't tell him that
I would perfect it by all means.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:14:00.320
Miss Layla had called me her partner,

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:03.760
and I just let it go to my head.

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:09.530
Having come this far, I finally realize
that my abilities are completely inadequate.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:13.530
I just feel like running away now.

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:15.160
I can't forgive myself!

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:18.310
You're doing more than enough, Sora.

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:21.940
But, if it's too tough,
I think it's okay to back out.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:24.670
I'm sure Miss Layla will understand.

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:29.280
Miss Layla told me once...

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:33.850
It's a nuisance if you're going to
prepare yourself with a half-baked attitude.

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:39.650
If quitting is better for Miss Layla, l...

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:43.230
It's very kind of you to come all the way here.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.470
Oh, that's fine.

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:45.530
Anyway,

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:49.140
I knew Sora was very a talented girl
and I expected a lot from her,

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:52.870
but I never realized she was so good she
could attempt that legendary great maneuver.

00:14:53.510 --> 00:14:55.110
Me too.

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:57.380
So, is this the first time since Arlon Brass?

00:14:57.380 --> 00:14:58.680
Yes.

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:02.420
Does that accident still weigh on your mind?

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.750
My feeling of regret has not disappeared.

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:10.530
He was reliable and very responsible,

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:12.690
but that challenge was reckless.

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:13.920
What?

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:19.030
The one who died attempting the
legendary great maneuver at Kaleido Stage

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:22.370
was Arlon Brass, the top star at the time.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.470
Yuri's father.

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:27.340
I confirmed the story with Jean,
so there's no doubt about it.

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:31.980
Those investors at Kaleido Stage
must have heard the story from Yuri.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:34.710
It's understandable why they don't
believe in the success of maneuver.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:37.210
So don't worry about it.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.480
So that's why...

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:42.790
I'm counting on you.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.380
I expect you to perfect
the maneuver without a hitch.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:53.870
Nobody, including Mr. Yuri, thinks
I'm able to perfect the legendary maneuver.

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:59.610
Well, the problem is how Sora
will react after this.

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:02.580
Whether she can rise out of the depths, or...

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:04.650
If she can't do it,

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:07.940
there is absolutely no way that she could
perform the legendary great maneuver.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:09.940
That's right.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:15.120
After all, you guys are the ones who created
"Freedom" when you were at the bottom.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:17.960
I'm counting on Sora.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:21.000
Did you back out of the investment

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.960
so you can let us experience
how we can rise up from the bottom?

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:25.400
That's part of it.

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:27.960
But I don't feel like doing
business with those guys.

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:35.380
Then I will deliver this to Miss Layla.

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:36.430
Okay.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:42.180
Sora said she doesn't want dinner tonight.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.390
Let's leave her alone.

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:45.820
Yeah...

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:52.790
Yes.

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:59.230
What is it?

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:03.390
Well, I was told by Miss Layla
not to talk about this, but...

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:20.020
Miss Layla,

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:21.420
I want to talk about something.

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:23.120
Miss Layla...

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:27.120
Ken...

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:30.360
Miss Layla is not here right now.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.520
She's out running.

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:33.700
Running?

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:34.960
At a time like this?

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:37.230
Yes. She's trying to lose weight.

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:38.730
Losing weight?

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:40.170
That's right.

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:44.580
Probably, the greater the weight
difference of the two performers,

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:47.010
the lower the chance of success
of the legendary great maneuver.

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:51.840
I bet Miss Layla realized what
the legendary great maneuver is.

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:56.280
I think it's almost time for her to come back.

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:03.660
You know, Miss Layla has been
eating her meals in her room these days.

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:04.500
Yes.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:07.070
But I heard she's not really eating most of it.

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:08.170
What?

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:10.200
Charlotte told me,

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:13.010
even though it seems she was told
not to talk about it.

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:16.070
Miss Layla is doing
all of this because of me...

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.520
Don't you think it's wrong
to blame yourself?

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:27.580
Partners are supposed to be equal.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:32.630
You're trying to be a
good partner for Miss Layla,

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:36.360
and she's also trying to be your partner.

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:38.760
Miss Layla?

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:42.430
I've admired her for a long time.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:46.700
It's true. You have something
I don't possess.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:50.770
This is a real fight between us.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:58.420
When I was a child,
I saw Kaleido Stage with my parents.

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:01.210
It was so wonderful. Like a dream.

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:06.820
It will not be my last show, unless I wish it.

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:14.060
Right now, I have a partner
who can make it possible.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.360
Miss Layla!

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:22.710
I think you guys are the best partners.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:26.680
Thank you, Ken.

00:19:30.990 --> 00:19:32.150
Miss Layla!

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:33.820
Sora!

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:37.830
I'm sorry!

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:40.330
I tried to run away.

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:43.900
Because the special training
is hard and painful,

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:48.400
I made excuses and told myself
that I don't have skills to be your partner!

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:50.700
I tried to run away by myself!

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:52.430
I'm sorry!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:55.440
I'll never doubt myself again!

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:59.380
I'll work much harder and catch up to you!

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:02.810
And I'm going to perfect
the legendary great maneuver by any means!

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:11.690
We came all this way to do just that.

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:15.090
Yes.

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:20.800
I'll eat a lot and build up muscle.

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:23.830
So please don't lose any more weight.

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:25.730
All right.

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.870
She really rose up.

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:32.750
Thank you so much.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.270
It was worth coming all the way here.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:39.880
A person who rises up from the bottom
is tougher for it.

00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:42.960
What? You mean you did this on purpose?

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:44.830
I'm wide awake now.

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:46.760
Bring me some bourbon, boy.

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:48.890
My name is Ken Robbins!

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:54.770
As partners, let's not keep
any secrets from now on.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:55.640
That's a good idea.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:57.230
It's a promise.

00:20:57.970 --> 00:20:59.510
Not yet...

00:20:59.510 --> 00:21:03.710
I can't give you qualification
to attempt that maneuver yet.

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:04.880
Moreover,

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:09.850
it seems like fate is trying to put you
through a more rigorous ordeal.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:13.750
If you're able to overcome it,
the time will come.

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:17.190
However, it is a brutal ordeal.

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:23.530
The reversed Empress.

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:30.460
Miss Layla!

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:31.930
What's wrong?

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:35.440
It's nothing.

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:38.110
Didn't you just hit your shoulder?

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:41.080
I just lost my balance
and scratched it a little.

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.280
Don't worry.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:44.580
But still, I think you should
go to see a doctor for just in case.

00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:46.580
I don't have time for that.

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:49.220
Now let's continue.

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:50.190
Yes.

00:21:54.360 --> 00:21:55.500
Good.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:58.060
She seems to be doing okay.

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:01.300
Damn.

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:03.500
Since I lost weight,
I passed out for a moment.

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:11.070
It seems my shoulder can somehow hold on.

00:22:19.890 --> 00:22:21.860
Next Kaleido Star

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:24.290
Please... a little longer...

00:22:24.290 --> 00:22:26.030
Please last a little longer.

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:28.130
And so, it's the day before the actual show.

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:31.860
But Miss Layla's injuries were worse
than anybody expected, and it was hopeless.

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:36.230
In spite of that, just what...
Just what drives you to go so far?

00:22:36.470 --> 00:22:39.510
What's the real reason
behind the heroic decision?

00:22:39.510 --> 00:22:40.970
What? What?

00:22:41.310 --> 00:22:42.510
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"An Amazing Bond"

00:22:42.510 --> 00:22:45.110
An Amazing Bond

00:22:42.510 --> 00:22:45.110
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"An Amazing Bond"

00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:45.510
An Amazing Bond

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:51.090
An Amazing Bond

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:51.090
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...

00:22:51.090 --> 00:23:02.090
<i>I'm here between the sky and the roads,
and facing against the wind</i>

00:22:51.090 --> 00:23:02.090
<i>Boku wa koko ni iru
sora to michi no aida de mukai kaze</i>

00:23:03.930 --> 00:23:17.710
<i>And I'm facing forward so the sorrow
doesn't rain down ever again</i>

00:23:03.930 --> 00:23:17.710
<i>Soshite mae o muiteiru,
mou nido to kanashimi ga furanai youni to</i>

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>I came all the way here after
I jumped over that wall</i>

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>Ano kabe o koete kokomade kitanda</i>

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:30.890
<i>There are many times
when I just want to run away</i>

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:30.890
<i>Nigedashitaku naru koto wa nando mo aru</i>

00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:36.300
<i>But I'm still here,
so, I'm not daunted that much</i>

00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:36.300
<i>Dakedo kokoni irunara taishite bibitte inai</i>

00:23:36.300 --> 00:23:43.840
<i>The poem I scribbled down, I can just
start writing over from the beginning</i>

00:23:36.300 --> 00:23:43.840
<i>Kakinaguri no uta "hajimekara yareba iisa"</i>

00:23:43.840 --> 00:23:49.300
<i>Unable to write it well, I'm laughing</i>

00:23:43.840 --> 00:23:49.300
<i>Umaku kakenaku te boku wa waratte iru</i>
